  "prefLabel": "Mec 802.03 Water treatment trainee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 802.03 “Water treatment trainee” means “water treatment trainee” as defined in RSA 153:27, namely, “any person who engaged in learning about and assisting in installing, maintaining, or repairing water treatment systems under the direct supervision of a water treatment technician certified under this subdivision.”\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec800.html"
